# The on-prem connector IS version-controlled: it is payroll-critical, it holds no secrets
# (everything comes from environment variables), and an untracked copy on one PC is how a
# three-day outage went unnoticed. Only its local runtime state is ignored.
connector/essl_state.json
connector/*.log
